      "blocks": {
        "p1": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>It was late May. Marcus was lying in bed scrolling his phone before the alarm went off. He opened a Bitcoin wallet app he'd installed six months earlier, the one tied to the little device behind his TV, and his eyes refused to process the number on the screen.</p>",
