    "bullets_features": {
      "type": "section",
      "name": "Features Bullets",
      "blocks": {
        "p": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Here's the part Marcus didn't understand until later. The Miner Forge Pro doesn't promise anything. It doesn't guarantee a payout. What it does is enter you into a global event that runs automatically, every ten minutes, twenty four hours a day. The Bitcoin network pays out a 3.125 BTC reward every ten minutes to whoever solves a math puzzle first. The Miner Forge Pro just keeps trying, quietly, forever, without you doing anything.</p>",
            "width": "100%",
            "max_width": "normal",
            "alignment": "left",
            "type_preset": "rte",
            "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
            "font_size": "1rem",
            "line_height": "normal",
            "letter_spacing": "normal",
            "case": "none",
